    "about_text": "Embark on a raw, soul-stirring motorcycling odyssey into the high-altitude wilderness of the Zanskar Valley with Trail Explorers. Designed for true nomads and riders, this 6-day expedition kicks off with an overnight transit from Delhi into the heart of Manali, where your machine waits. Roar through the engineering marvel of the Atal Tunnel, cross the dramatic Lahaul Valley via Sissu, and conquer the towering Shinku La Pass at 16,580 feet to enter the uncharted realms of Zanskar. Feel the nomadic pulse as you pitch camp under a star-lit sky right beside the sacred monolith peak of Gonbo Rangjon, standing tall like a giant guardian of the mountains. Ride across rugged off-road tracks toward Purne, park your machine, and trek up to the breathtaking cliffside Phuktal Cave Monastery, carved raw into ancient rock faces. Blending high-altitude biking thrills, soulful campfire nights under mountain stars, local homestay warmth, and deep Himalayan exploration, this circuit is crafted for riders seeking the ultimate offbeat escape from the ordinary.",
