    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "CAN I RIDE MY OWN MOTORCYCLE FOR THIS CIRCUIT OR IS RENTAL MANDATORY?",
        "answer": "You can either ride our expedition motorcycles included in the package or bring your own well-maintained 350cc+ motorcycle, provided it undergoes a safety check by our lead mechanic."
      },
      {
        "question": "HOW DO WE HANDLE LUGGAGE SINCE THERE IS NO BACKUP VEHICLE?",
        "answer": "Riders carry their gear in saddlebags or a secure backpack on their own bikes, allowing complete riding freedom on narrow off-road Zanskar tracks."
      },
      {
        "question": "WHAT KIND OF TERRAIN AND ROAD CONDITIONS CAN WE EXPECT AFTER SHINKU LA?",
        "answer": "Expect a raw mix of loose gravel, dirt tracks, water crossings, and high-altitude mountain passes where throttle and clutch control are key."
      },
      {
        "question": "ARE PHONE NETWORK AND MOBILE CONNECTIVITY AVAILABLE IN ZANSKAR?",
        "answer": "Postpaid connections (primarily BSNAL and limited Jio/Airtel) work up to Sissu and Jispa, but expect absolute digital blackout deeper into the Zanskar wilderness."
      },
      {
        "question": "WHAT IS THE ARRANGEMENT FOR BIKE FUEL DURING THE ZANSkar RIDE?",
        "answer": "Fuel is included for the 3 riding days, and we carry extra fuel supplies at strategic check-points since high-altitude fuel stations are sparse."
      },
      {
        "question": "HOW SHOULD I PACK TO HANDLE RAPID TEMPERATURE DROPS IN GONBO RANGJON?",
        "answer": "Pack in strict layers including a thermal base, windproof-waterproof riding jacket, high-altitude gloves, and sturdy riding boots as night temperatures near the monolith drop sharply."
      },
      {
        "question": "IS FUEL CONSUMPTION OR REPAIR FOR MINOR FALLS CHARGED EXTRA?",
        "answer": "Fuel for the designated itinerary is included, but any intentional damage, major parts breakage, or careless handling resulting in mechanical failure is chargeable."
      },
      {
        "question": "WHAT IS THE SLEEPING ARRANGEMENT AT GONBO RANGJON AND JISPA CAMPS?",
        "answer": "Sturdy high-altitude camping tents equipped with thick insulating mattresses and heavy comfort sleeping bags are provided for a cozy, warm night."
      },
      {
        "question": "CAN VEGETARIAN AND HIGH-ALTITUDE ENERGY MEALS BE CUSTOMIZED?",
        "answer": "Yes, hot, freshly cooked, nutritious vegetarian meals and hot beverages are served regularly to keep your energy levels soaring at high altitudes."
      },
      {
        "question": "WHAT HAPPENS IN CASE OF SUDDEN ROADBLOCKS OR EXTREME WEATHER DELAYS?",
        "answer": "Our experienced Road Captain assesses the situation on the ground, and alternate safety protocols or extended stay arrangements are coordinated as per local mountain conditions."
      }
    ],
