        "details": "Wake up early to catch a breathtaking sunrise painting the crystal-clear waters of Pangong Tso. After breakfast, journey back to Leh crossing the formidable Chang La Pass, stopping briefly at the top for photos. En route, make stops to visit the historic Thiksey Monastery and Rancho School before reaching Leh for evening leisure and souvenir shopping."
