        "details": "Savor a wholesome breakfast at the Chatru campsite before boarding the return transport at 8:00 AM. Experience an adventurous off-road mountain drive through Chandra Valley, passing Gramphu and crossing through the iconic 9.02 km Atal Tunnel beneath the Rohtang Ridge. Arrive back at Manali by afternoon, marking the grand finale of your Himalayan crossover expedition with lifelong memories and strong mountain bonds."
